/obj/item/readable
	icon = 'grafon/item/book.dmi'
	beltable = 1
	name = "Some book"
	icon_state = "brown"
	var/txt = "<B>Хуй!</B><HR>\n<B>Пизда!</B><BR>\n<B>Колбаса!</B><BR>\nяяяяяяяяяяяяяяяяяяяя<BR>"
/var/syndie_txt = "You must be new here, uh?<BR>\nOkay, here's the list of stuff you can order before going <s>nuts</s> on your mission:<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Stealthy stuff:</B><HR>\n<B>Consolehack (1):</B> fucks with electronic devices, either breaking them or unlocking hidden functions. Especially useful to operator.<BR>\n<B>Fake blood scanner (2):</B> looks just like a common blood scanner, but will inject its victim with fuckload of godawful toxins. Can be used only once.<BR>\n<B>Door brutforcer (2):</B> rapes door's lock, reseting its access. You have to stay still for a while for properly brutforcing, however. It looks like a common assistant key for more CONSPIRACY, but don't be fooled: this baby is extremely useful since idiotic crew may not detect a brutforced door for a loooong time.<BR>\n\n<BR>\n<B>Arms and explosivities:</B><HR>\n<B>Tzar-syringe (2):</B> a syringe able to hold up to 15pts of chemicals. Can be loaded in syringe gun, but best used for instainjecting people with toxic stuff.<BR>\n<B>Torture whip (2):</B> more powerful version of security neurowhip, causes ungodly pain which usually results in chronodepr, stun, knockout and damage.<BR>\n<B>Starsalve bottle (2):</B> a large bottle filled with 70 units of starsalve: antiburn salve which works as horrible venom if injected or swallowed. Stundarts, force-feeding and tzar-syringe injectioning are the best ways of delivery, obviously.<BR>\n<B>Katana (2):</B> mostly just pretentious toy than actual weapon, this thing, however, is able to cut limbs and heads easily.<BR>\n<B>Grenade pack (3):</B> three grenades: one filled with liquid smoke and two - with a bit of nitroglycerol. Break doors, walls, skulls and bones, then fill every fucking thing with toxic smoke!<BR>\n<B>Bourgeous bomb (4):</B> this is why station looks like swiss cheese every motherfucking day. A relatively powerful, but stationary bomb. Deploy it somewhere, set the timer then turn it on and run like there's no tomorrow. Also, works with teleminers!<BR>\n<B>Single-tank bomb (4):</B> if you're too lazy for bomb-fabricating or just don't have a clue HWO 2 MAEK BOMBZ, you can order this thing, then patch it with ignition system (signaller+igniter is preferable) and blow the fuckers up.<BR>\n<B>Plus-axe (5):</B> yeaaaa, THAT'S the stuff! Ultimate melee weapon which also makes you unstunnable while holding it, So thrill might be surprisingly effective against proton axe bearers. You can wear it on belt, through. It'll still protect you from pain and stun. Able to cut walls and grilles like butter.<BR>\n\n<BR>\n<B>Other:</B><HR>\n<B>Stimpack (1):</B> syringe filled with mutagenerite (heals 10 of each type of damage), adrenaline (makes you stand up instantly after stun) and heroin (calms you down and causes euphoria).<BR>\n<B>Robotic enslavement module (1):</B> forces robots to work for you, obviously. Yep, you can use it on nukebot so he'll both help you and try to nuke station the fuck up.<BR>\n<B>Infected syringe (1):</B> syringe infected with AIDS. AIDS kills its victim fucking slow and is curable, but the cure is kinda difficult to find (and it can be some toxic crap) and AIDS grants its victim with far more dangerous diseases like neurosyphilis. Keep in mind what any syringe will be infected after contact with AIDS-positive blood!<BR>\n<B>Capitalistic spacesuit (2):</B> for those too lazy to rob EVA. Protects better than common spacegear, but everyone will try to kill you while you're wearing this.<BR>\n<B>Magic wrench (3):</B> a tool able to unwrench some things meant to stay in place at any conditions. Usually used for instabreaking doors, windows and grilles, but you can do a lot funny shit with it.<BR>\n\n"

/obj/item/readable/examine()
	usr << browse(HTML_SKELETON(src.txt))


/obj/item/readable/chemistry
	name = "Chemistry basics"
	icon_state = "white"
	txt = "<B>A very basics of chemistry</B><HR>\n\n<B>Medicine and helpful shit</B><BR>\n\n<BR>\nAntidote = cellulose + manganese<BR>\nA wonderful chemical, purging your blood out of a majority of dangerous toxins and slowly healing organ damage. Some of the horrible chemicals are not removed by antidote, however.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nRegenerite = antidote + aluminum; also, regeneshrooms<BR>\nIf medics are not dead or rampaging, they'll usually just run around injecting sick people with this stuff. Regenerite slowly heals organ damage when injected and a huge chunk of brute - then splashed on one's mug.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nFibgenerite = regenerite + plant oil<BR>\nA stuff for rapidly healing even heaviest of the burn damage. IV/peroral usage can help against open wounds as well. Kinda difficult to make since both regenerite and oil are fucking expensive.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nPotassium permanganate = manganese + potassium<BR>\nPoor man's antidote or something. Purges your blood and cures nausea. Also, cures codeine and morphine OD by making you vomit some of this stuff out. Yep, even if you shot morphine IV. Don't ask me how it works.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nMangadote = guess it by yourself, fucker<BR>\nLike antidote, but better. Rapidly removes toxins from one's body as well as healing organ damage. Works against codeine/morphine OD as well.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nProthesine = regenerite + ammonia<BR>\nUsed for prothesing of lost limbs. Inject one with some of this stuff then just stick a lost arm in place. Yea, it is THAT easy.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nWarnipizine = adamantane + F.U.E.L.<BR>\nHeals your wounds (but usually not all of them) and (rarely) brute damage. Also grants you with shitty smoking mixes high (especially at large doses). You can use it as a \"liquid bondage\" or just for getting shitty high.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nFoam powder = sodium + hydrogen<BR>\nMix it with water to create a crapload of firefighting foam. Very useful if TOXINS ON FAER!!11 or if shitcurity/traitors are spamming smoke grenades again.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nMontage foam powder = foam powder + ???<BR>\nSpams montage foam instead of firefighting one when mixed with water. Engineers start with some for prefering people from running into burning, gas-filled, space-adjacent hellholes.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nGlucose = nope, extract it from delicious plants<BR>\nA component of the 'White squirrel' anti-delirious pills. Heals booze hangover, as well as removing ethanol and methanol from your blood. Also, you can eat a fuckload of it if you're hungry to fill your stomach.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nNutriment = carbon + ammonia + F.U.E.L.<BR>\nSynthetic proteine or something. Used in production of barbiturates and some other chemicals.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nAmbrosine = toxin + ??? + ???<BR>\nAn ultimate chemical, healing any kind of damage rapidly if you're experiencing strong euphoria. There's expensive syrup called 'Ambrobene+' and containing both ambrosine and codeine, so you can get both healed and fucked up.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nDextroamitriptine = toxin + nicotine<BR>\nHeals stim and nicotine addiction VERY fast. Avaible in tobacco vendors, medbay and psychiatry.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nParacetamol = nope, but there's plenty of it in some preciption pills<BR>\nHeals your from cough (which is currently kinda difficult to get). Fucks up your organs if overdosed (25+ pts).<BR>\n\n<BR>\nYeast = yeast + ammonia or nutriment<BR>\nYeast can be used for brewing GABA, ethanol and some other shit. It is currently only used as a catalyser only in a production of succinic acid, so you, probably, should grow as many of it from ammonia as possible if you don't want to get short on this stuff while brewing a shitton of shit-tier booze from synthetic sugar.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nSuccinic acid = yeast (catalyser) + glucose<BR>\nShoot or chew some of this precious thing before doing booze, heroin, benzos or any other sedative (expect GABAs) to soften your hangover and slow down addiction. Also, can be used as an antidote on poor fuckers ODed on GABA derivatives.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nGABA = yeast + ???; also, grown in botany<BR>\nA component of many fucked up drugs and a reason why tea in USSR-4 feels soooo goddamn good if you drink 9001 cups of it. Causes mild euphoria if mixed with some other drugs, calms you down and heals tension.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nPiracetam = GABA + toxin<BR>\nHeals over-sedatation, drowsiness and reduces stuntime a bit. Shoot it with a bit of regenerite to the fucktards stupid enough to OD on sedative pills. Also, used in brain receptors damage healing.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nBaclofen = GABA + ???<BR>\nCures tension (a common effect of drug hangover) and thrill. Causes euphoria if ODed. Causes organ damage and fucks your speech up if even more ODed.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nPhenibut = GABA + ???<BR>\nShort-term, but quite powerful stuff very similar to baclofen. Shoot some into hangovering junkie's gutter to make him feel better. Used in brain receptors damage healing, but only if ODed.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nPhenotropil = Phenibut + ???<BR>\nA lot like phenibut, but will also stimulate you a bit. Can be used either in place of caffeine, piracetam or any GABA deriative. Can be used in brain receptors damage healing, but only if ODed, similar to phenibut.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nFluoxetine = ambrosine + F.U.E.L.<BR>\nPsychiatrist's happy pills for curing chronic depression. While it will also remove dysphoria, it wouldn't make you happier if you're already feel fine.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nHaloperidol = fluorine + ???<BR>\nSince there's a bottle of haloperidol in medbay from the start, you'll probably see medics rampaging and injecting random people with this shit. However, it can be also used for curing psychedelic drugs overdose and (in huge doses) for healing damaged brain receptors. Mix it with some regenerite, however, if you don't want to hurt your <s>victim</s> patient!<BR>\n\n<BR>\nAminazine = methanol + ???<BR>\nA.K.A. thorazine. Yet another neuroleptic drug, along with haloperidol. Works just the same, but, unlike halo, it'll only damage its patient if heavily ODed. You can still give some to stun-happy medics, since 6+ pts of this crap will still knock people on their backs (so rampageous fucktards will have to inject their victims 2 times instead of 1).<BR>\n\n<BR>\nClozapine = toxin + benzodiazepine<BR>\nFinally: anti-psychotic which will not turn you into babbling vegetable with rotten liver! Used in case of delirium, psychedelic OD and psychosis, not unlike neuros. It is very difficult to stun somebody with it, however.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nCarbamazepine = benzodiazepine + nitrogen + potassium<BR>\nSoftens pain, thrill, tension, delirium and psychosis, as well as calms you down, but without any removal of psychoactive shit from your bloodstream. Kinda weak on itself, but can be combined with either neuroleptics or clozapine to potent them. Cures dysphoria and even depression on rare occasions, but usually fluoxetine is powerful enough on its own. Causes drowsiness when ODed (15+ pts).<BR>\n\n<BR>\nNaloxone = yeast + methanol + oxycodone<BR>\nHelps to cure opiate addiction and lock down opioid receptors, preventing junkies from dying of ODing (as well as taking pleasure from any opi drugs but bupr). Cures booze, DXM or opioid poisoning at a very quick rate. Oxycodone is expensive and is a pain in the ass to get hands on, but it is oxy, not yeast being used as catalyser, so go nuts: you'll still be able to get fucked up after brewing a whole barrel of naloxone. Also, you can detect opiate junkies with this shit: just inject one with some so he will fall down in pain.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nFlumazenil = iodine + silicon (yep, it is easy to synth!)<BR>\nLocks down benzo receptors in a same way as naloxone does with opi ones as well as curing heavy benzodiazepines addiction.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nASD = nutriment + iodine + polonium, then heat to 1<BR>\nHelps against radioactive poisoning and cures mutations... at least, sometimes. Do not OD, since on dosages higher than 5 it will become both toxic and useless.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nASD-F0 = ASD + iron<BR>\nA potent tissue threatment drug, the best way to deal with brute damage without splashing people with buckets of regenerite.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nBarbital = urea + nutriment<BR>\nA sedative drug, cures you of panic, tension and thrill. Kinda addictive, however.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nPentobarbital = urea + sodium. + ???<BR>\nHalf the dose of barbital, thus easy to OD.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nPhenobarbital = urea + F.U.E.L. + ???<BR>\nYet another barbiturate. A bit weaker against barbital, but lasts for far longer.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nBenzodiazepine = ethanol + carboxylic acid<BR>\nYeaaaa. Less addictive and more effective against barbital. Obviously, used in synthesis of all of the benzos: phenazepam (benzo fury), diazepam (Valium), clonazepam (klono), cosmozepam, cognitozepam and other shit. Gotta catch'em all!<BR>\n\n<BR>\nGabapentin = carboxylic acid + nitrogen<BR>\nCalms you down and cures epilepsy. Also, potents sedative drugs (booze, benzos, barbi, GABAs, carbamazepine and opiates). Causes weak benzo-alike effect if ODed (20+ pts). Way lot cheaper to product against benzos, but runs out kinda fast, so use larger doses. Goes great with tea, since it contains both GABA (which will be potented) and coffeine (which will cure you of drowsiness).<BR>\n\n<BR>\nLithium oxybutyrate = GBL + lithium\nCauses VERY mild euphoria, cures thrill, tension, have some antidepressant props and calms you down. Good for curing addicts, since it is more effective in cases of booze, opioid, benzo and barbiturate addiction against other GABA-b stuff. Also, does not cause addiction like baclofen, lyrica or GHB, but removes its effects while it is in your blood.ODing on it (taking more than 30pts of stuff) can and will cause epilepsy and other crap.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nAdamantane = toxin + hydrogen + aluminum<BR>\nA weak antiviral drug, used in synthesis of some more potent stuff.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nAmantadine = adamantane + sulfuric acid + ???<BR>\nA potent flu treatment, sold on some of the USSR-4 bases and stations as an over-the-counter drug known as 'Midantan'. While it actually good for both curing flu and softening AIDS symptomatology, there are reports of side-effects on even lesser excessing of the dose.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nRimantadine = adamantane + aluminum + lithium<BR>\nA weaker analogue of amantadine, harder to OD, but somewhat less effective.<BR>\n\n\n<BR>\n<B>Space NRA</B><BR>\n\n<BR>\nAqua Regia = just try to remember your chemistry classes in middle school, fucktard<BR>\nA mighty acid, able to melt floors if you get enough of it. Heat it up to fuck up everything around with nasty vapours.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nMethanol = cellulose + water<BR>\nCauses weak organ damage and random blinding. Not very great on its own, but can be used in many reactions.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nToxin = F.U.E.L. + ???<BR>\nNot THAT powerful, but still able to rape one's organs. Used in many reactions.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nCorpse rot = toxin + ???<BR>\nCauses limbs to literally rot off if you're able to inject/force-feed somebody with enough of this shit. Combine with scalpel so even more hilarity will happen! Splashing also works, but far worse against either peroral or IV usage.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nBiotoxin = F.U.E.L. + ???<BR>\nWeaker if compared to even toxin, but will cause a victim to go blind from time to time. Excretes out at a very slow rate and you need only a small dosage of it to work properly, so it is a good idea to combine it with another nasty chemical. Partially absorbable by human skin.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nAtropine = biotoxin + carboxylic acid + ???; also, grown in botany<BR>\nCauses stun, ungodly delirium and small organ damage at the same time. 10+ pts will rape one's organs at the power close to starsalve, so force-feeding is a key to victory. It is also partially absorbable by one's skin, so splash your victim with a bucket of it and wait for hilarity ensuing.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nBotox = yeast + ???<BR>\nWhile this stuff will cure you of pain and thrill, consumption of 3+ points will distort its victim speech and cause both randomstunning and massive organ damage. Due to the large dosage, it might be quite a tricky deal to murder somebody with botox, but force-feeding, splashing and spamming injections will help you in stuffing some poor soul with this horrible shit.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nStrychnine = acetic anhydride + ???<BR>\nWorks very similar to caffeine if taken in lesser doses, fucks you up with thrill, randomstun and organ damage when ODed (3+ pts). Since even short-term stunning will cause its victim to drop all items, this stuff can be surprisingly effective.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nThiopental = barbital + ???<BR>\nCauses drowsiness when injected in dosage of 3+pts. Fucks you up pretty hard on 20+pts. Makes its victim go to sleep, then wake up, then go to sleep, the wake up and so on until excreted.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nLiquid vacuum = biotoxin + ???<BR>\nWhile not as soulcrushingly toxic as starsalve or botox, but able to deal damage of all three kinds (since you're literally inject your victim with liquid space). Can be shaked to create \"anti-explosion\".<BR>\n\n<BR>\nAmalgam = mercuty + nitric acid + ???<BR>\nWeaker than even toxin, but will rape its victim for longer. Also, used in some other reactions.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nBerserk potion<BR>\nDrink some booze and eat some special shrooms to get batshit insane, swinging at random people around. Not too useful, but still funny.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nLiquid smoke = sugar + ???<BR>\nA horrible chemical, spamming overheated toxic smoke when mixed with water. Yep, it is the shit from security smoke grenades.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nNapalm = liquid smoke + ???<BR>\nEven more fucked up than liquid smoke, since it'll spam raging fire. Perfectly good for cleaning rooms out of blade weeds, amoebas and people.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nGlycerol = plant oil + ???<BR>\nUsed in the creation of nitroglycerin, obviously.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nNitrocellulose = cellulose + ???<BR>\nFar weaker against nitroglycerin, but you have a fuckload of cellulose from the start. Explodes either on shake or on heating.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nSpess gunpowder = nitrocellulose + carbon + ???<BR>\nOnly a bit weaker than nitroglycerin, but explodes not on shake, but on heating it up to 2+.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nPolytrinic acid = ??? + ???<BR>\nAn ultimate tool for raping floors, walls and people's faces. If you're not too retarded, you should already know how to make vapour grenades. So do it, faggot.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nBlack yeast = yeast + chlorine + ???<BR>\nA tiny fungi with a mixture of potent toxins as a metabolism byproduct. Can be grown on nutriment if you're short of chlorine for some reason.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nNeurobacteria = black yeast + ??? + ???<BR>\nActually not a bacteria, but a fungus colony. Causes space neurosyphilis: a horrid STD able to seriously fuck up host's limbs. If <b>you</b>'re suffering from neurosyphilis yourself, you should either take some mercury or some toxin. No, I'm no kiddin'<BR>\n\n<BR>\nStarsalve = plant oil + ???<BR>\nWhile splashing somebody with it will heal some burn damage, injecting or force-feeding this hellish shit will fuck poor bastard up in a few cycles. Also avaible to PD and traitor chemists.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nmutagen = ASD + polonium + ???<BR>\nCauses mutations from time to time. Do not try to inject a fuckload of it to heighten your chances to become superhero!<BR>\n\n<BR>\nNovichok agent = ASD + ??? + ???<BR>\nA radioactive and extremely toxic agent. No more info avaible.<BR>\n\n<BR>\n<B>Drugs oh yeaaaaa</B><BR>\n\n<BR>\nPhenethylamine = carboxylic acid + ???<BR>\nUsed in synthesis of DO* and 2C-* drugs, as well as 25i-NBOME and MDA (and MDMA-alike amphetamines).<BR>\n\n<BR>\nTryptamine = nutriment + ammonium hydroxide + ???<BR>\nLike phenethylamine, but for tryptamine drugs (obviously).<BR>\n\n<BR>\n4-AcO-DMT = psilocybin + ???<BR>\nA drug somewhat similar to both shrooms and DMT. It is a good idea to ask botanists to grow a fuckload of shrooms then synth some AcO-DMT since latter has smaller dosage (profit!). Also, there're 4 (!) reactions of getting this drug, but all of them request psilocybin as one of the components.<BR>\n\n<BR>\n2C-H = phenethylamine + ???<BR>\nWhile not psychoactive on itself, 2C-H is a cornerstone in synthesis of all of the 2C-* and 25*-NBOME drugs.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nBenzaldehyde = nope, but orderable via both encryptor and orders console<BR>\nUsed in synthesis of speed and 25i-NBOME.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nAB-228 = adamantane + ???<BR>\nWeak synthetic cannabinoid, used in production of far more potent drugs such as APICA and APINACA.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nMethyl acetate = carboxylic acid + methanol<BR>\nSee below.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nAnhydride = methyl acetate + ???<BR>\nAny junkie will tell you what acetic anhydride is needed for.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nLSD = pogankeepeptide + ???<BR>\nSeriously, should I explain anything? Well, LSD is a potent psychedelic drug, used by cognitologists along with phenethylamines, dissociatives and tryptamines to get extremely fucked up. Botanists can also grow woodrose to get their injection-crippled hands on LSA - somewhat similar stuff.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nGBL = GABA + hydrogen<BR>\nA.K.A. gamma-butyrolactone, far less effective as a recreational drug against GHB, but can be used to synth GHB and lithium oxybutirate.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nGHB = GBL + ???<BR>\nA.K.A. hydroxybutyrate, 'butrik' or 'buratino'. A lot like GABA, but more euphoretic and grants you raging boner. Inject 999999 units of GHB into donut and feed it to some fucker, then rape him. DO IT FAGGOT<BR>\n\n<BR>\nAmphetamine = benzaldehyde + amalgam<BR>\nSecurity happy pills, will make you run rapid as fuck as well as causing euphoria and stimulation. Yes, I don't hide a recipe from you since both of the reagents are already pain in the ass to get one's hand on.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nMDPV = benzaldehyde + F.U.E.L. + ???<BR>\nAmphetamine 2: Electric Boogaloo. Somewhat cheaper to produce, but sucks against speed.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nMethcathinone = (pseudo)ephedrine + ???<BR>\nA.k.a. ephedrone, a.k.a. jeff, a.k.a. mulka, a.k.a. martsefal'. Similar to speed, but fucking addictive, easy to OD and you don't need a barrel of benzaldehyde to mass-produce it.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nEphedrine/pseudoephedrine = nope, grown in botany. Also, energy drinks<BR>\nA lot alike speed, but almost without hastening. Used in meth production.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nOpium = nope, grown in botany<BR>\nA cornerstone of all opiates, produced from the poppy heads.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nDesomorphine = guess it by yourself, c'mon, it is easy!<BR>\nPowerful, but addictive and harmful for one's health opiate. Inferiour to heroin, however.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nHeroin = morphine + ???<BR>\nOnly inferior to methadone. If codeine and tramadol is not enough for you, you'll start to shoot this crap kinda soon.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nOxycodone = thebaine + bromine + ???<BR>\nThe only good way to use thebaine (which is basically shit-tier strychnine). This shit have tiny dosages and kinda easy to OD (and the only cure - namely naloxone - can only be synthesed with oxy as catalyser), so be warned.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nNuclear titbit = ??? + ???<BR>\nYou want to know what is the nuclear titbit!<BR>\n\n<BR>\nDPH = grown in hydro; also, Dimedrol pills<BR>\nWorks very similar to dicyclomine, but also can be used to potentiate euphoretic effects of opioid drugs. ODing will cause hellish delirium, so be warned.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nTropicamide = carboxylic acid + ???<BR>\nJust like DPH, but will also potentiate stims and is easier to overdose. Delirium is a shitty thing, but cognitologists sometimes will use stuff like this to get completely batshit insane.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nNnicotine = nutriment + ???<BR>\nStuff from cigs, chewing tobacco and chainsmokin' injectors. You can use it one time in a 10 chemticks for getting any result (\"Time to smoke!\" message) and its dose should be <=0.5pts. Makes you happy for a short time, as well as insta enslaves you with addiction (so you will either smoke this crap until the shuttle or wait for 15 chemticks of \"OH FUCK I WANT TO SMOKE SO BADLY\"). Potents strong opiates and all of the stims as well. Oh, yeah, and it is mutagenic, but far less against ACTUAL mutagen.<BR>\n\n<BR>\n<B>Other crap</B><BR>\n\n<BR>\nRhinestones = aluminum + carbon<BR>\nCan be evapourated for making everything shiny as fuck. Also, heals homos (inferior to regenerite, through).<BR>\n\n<BR>\nFagenerite = rhinestones + ???<BR>\nTurns you into a faggot, literally. Gay sex is a good way to feel euphoretic (especially if you're on libido-increasing drugs), but don't forget what fucking with your co-workers is illegal!<BR>\n\n<BR>\nInytropidril = ??? + ???<BR>\nWill have random effects every fucking day. This can vary from foul-mouth shouting and regenerite-alike healing to the horrible organ mutilation or injecting powerful drugs into your bloodstream. Go and find what it will do today by yourself!<BR>\n\n<BR>\nWarpotoxin = phosphorus + ???<BR>\nForces its victim to jump through bluespace randomly from time to time. Don't ask me how it works, however. It will also deal small organ/brute damage, so it is one of the very few chemicals able to punch one's ugly face instead of rotten liver, but the output is too small for making it into an effective venom.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nNitrogen tourettinide = ammonia + ???<BR>\nMakes you shout at random people and distorts your speech if taken in larger dosages. Will deal tiny organ damage if you force-feed someone 9001 pts of this crap.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nLuckstone dust = phenethylamine + methanol + ???<BR>\nStuff found by miners in luckstones, increases one's luck with a random effectivity.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nLye = hydrogen + either potassium on sodium<BR>\nHeats up when mixed with water (10 of both lye and water will add 2.1 temp to 100pts of chemicals). Also, used in hydro.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nUrea = ammonia + carbon<BR>\nMostly used in production of barbiturates.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nLiquid steel = iron + carbon + F.U.E.L., then heat up to 1<BR>\nActually, this thing is not a liquid (molten) steel, but a gel which will turn into accurate sheets of metal if you splash it somewhere. Useful if all miners are dead and engies or robotics need another 9000 metal sheets.<BR>\n\n<BR>\nFuelsaccharose = F.U.E.L. + sugar<BR>\nThis stuff is not toxic, nor it is satiating. However, rumors are that it can be used in a synthesis of some extremely potent drugs (2C-B-FLY? MXE?)<BR>\n\n"

/obj/item/readable/chemistry

/obj/item/readable/tele
	name = "Basic teleportation IDs"
	txt = "<B>Basic teleportation IDs</B><HR>\n<BR>\nSince construction of non-bluespace teleporters currently is relatively cheap, they're widely used on USSR-4 spacecraft complexes for easier access to outposts, departaments and other subjects to complex.<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>assist</B> - leads to eastern maint teleporter/tool storage linkage.<BR>\n<B>engi</B> - leads to eastern maint teleporter/engineering departament linkage.<BR>\n<B>assist2</B> - leads to northwestern/southern maint teleportation linkage.<BR>\n<B>cognitology</B> - leads to cognitology/psychiatry station.<BR>\n<B>mine</B> - leads to mining/purificator asteroid.<BR>\n<B>satellite</B> - leads to observation satellite. <B>WARNING:</B> it is strongly not recommended to access this teleporter without permission of captain or, at least, chief enginer since there were unknown (and potentially dangerous) objects (spacecrafts?) detected in front of satellite.<BR>\n<B>psychomed</B> - leads to psychiatrist/medical wing connection teleporter.<BR>\n<B>purificator</B> - leads to purificator outpost.<BR>\n"

/obj/item/readable/tele

