	name = "Young terrorist's handbook"
	txt = "So, here we fucking go.<BR>\n<BR>\n\n<B>Okay, HOW I do drugz?</B><HR>\nWell.<BR>\n<BR>\nSome of the drugs have tiny dosages (most of the psychedelics as well as salvia, god-tier benzos and opiates) and will rape you while ODed. There are two ways to avoid oxycodone overdose or bad trip for 999  hours:<BR>\n1)Use MicroDropper (actually just a 0.1 syringe) avaible to psychiatrist, cognitologists and chemists. Easy as hell and fast.<BR>\n2)Use math to dilute your drug with water and then split the solution apart until you get the proper dosage. Very fucking boring.<BR>\nMost of the blotters and one-usage shit avaible both legally and through black market already will have a proper (but less than needed for cognitology mindbreak) dosage, but don't blame us if you just smoked \"Salvia Extractx999\" and got off the rocket.<BR>\nAlso, you can use any antipsychotic drugs to get rid of either stims, dissociatives or psychedelics if you're feel like partying too hard. Shoot benzos, GABAs or barbi (or booze, lol) to get rid of panic. Psychiatrist's den was placed so close to cognitology for a reason.<BR>\n\n<BR>\n\n<B>It is all fine, but HWO I do drugzzzz???</B><HR>\n<BR>\n<B>The exact dosages for drugs are:</B><BR>\n<BR>\nBooze: each 5pts of ethanol give you a next stage of drunkeness, up to 6 at 30+. Taking barbiturates, benzos and some other stuff while on 2+ (or 1+ if talking of heavy stuff like clonazepam) of \"drunkeness\" is usually suicidal.<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Stims</B><BR>:\nSpeed/Dextroamph: up to 4.5, 4+ causes jitterness, 2.25+ for IV rush, tracks of >0.09<BR>\nLevometh (common meth from pseudoephedrine)/Dextrometh: up to 3.7, 1.85+ for IV rush, 3+ causes jitterness, tracks of >0.09<BR>\nEphedrine: 6 to 10<BR>\nPseudoephedrine: 8 to 10<BR>\nMDPV: up to 3.7, 2.23+ for IV rush, tracks of >0.1\nMethcathinone: up to 4, 3.8+ causes jitterness, 2+ for IV rush, tracks of >0.09<<BR>\n4-FA/Meow-meow: up to 3, 1.5+ causes jitterness, 2+ for IV rush, tracks of >0.09<<BR>\nCocaine: up to 5, 2.5+ causes jitterness, 4+ for IV rush, tracks of >1.5<<BR>\n<BR>\nAll of the stims (including piracetam, coffee, tea and lesser doses of ephedrine) have mild stun-shortening effect and makes you immune to drowsiness, so you can ignore thiopental darts and eat as many benzos as you like without falling asleep. Tobacco instantly removes drowsiness, but don't forget what it is fucking addictive (but it relatively is easy to fucking stop smoking), horribly cancerogenic and you need to wait 10 chemticks between taking a dose of nicotine.<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Barbiturates:</B><BR>\nBarbital/phenobarbital: up to 10 (9+ for drowsiness)<BR>\nPentobarbital/amobarbital: up to 5 (4.5+ for drowsiness). Yea, this thing is nasty<BR>\nThiopental: up to 15 (!), 3+ for heavy drowsiness<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Benzos:</B><BR>\nBenzodiazepine: up to 20 (10+ for drowsiness)<BR>\nPhenazepam: up to 25 (5+ for drowsiness)<BR>\nDiazepam: up to 25 (7+ for drowsiness)<BR>\nMidazolam: up to 12 (yeah, it is easy to OD). 3+ for drowsiness, 6+ for MOAR drowsiness<BR>\nTriazolam: up to 25 (8+ for drowsiness)<BR>\nAlprazolam: up to 25 (3+ for drowsiness)<BR>\nClonazepam: up to 10 (0.4+ for drowsiness)<BR>\nNitrazepam: up to 14 (0.4+ for drowsiness)<BR>\nFlunitrazepam: up to 14, 1+ for drowsiness. >2 with 4+ of ethanol causes dangerous vegetable-alike condition, very popular for date rapes<BR>\nCosmozepam: up to 6.5 (0.2+ for drowsiness)<BR>\nCognitozepam: up to 1, ALWAYS cause drowsiness<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>GABAs:</B><BR>\nGABA: up to 30, (almost) isn't euphoretic on itself but very useful in case of dysphoria or mixed with gabapentin<BR>\nGHB: up to 20, 10+ may (and will!) cause epilepsy, 25+ will make things even nastier<BR>\nBaclofen: starts with 2, up to 15, 10+ may (and will!) cause epilepsy, 17.5+ will make things even nastier<BR>\nPregabalin: starts with 3, up to 15, 17.5+ will make things even nastier, always makes you thrill<BR>\nPhenibut: up to 15, hits you fast, but lasts shorter against other GABAs. 15+ can heal your brain receptors<BR>\nPhenotropil: shares dosage with phenibut. Also heals brain receptors when ODed<BR>\nNote what ODing on benzos will make you feel mild euphoria, but can be dangerous, especially - when combined with booze. Also, benzos, barbis, GHB and baclofen are addictive so don't eat them in huge doses or too frequently (or, at least, buy/whine to chemist, psychiatrist or doctor/steal/precipt for yourself some glucose, succinic acid and withdrawal softeners). All of the GABAs can cure other sedatives addiction, so you can also use gabalon pills which are not addictive themselves. Oh, and succinic acid is an antidote for all of the GABAs.<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>MDMA-alike amphetamines:</B><BR>\nMDA: 30,40,50 for breaking different receptors<BR>\nMDMA/MDOH: 20,30,40 for breaking different receptors<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Tryptamines:</B><BR>\nDMT: 0.3+ for mindbreak, 0.05+ for OH FUCK WHATS GOING ON<BR>\n5-MeO-DMT: 0.6+ for mindbreak AND for OH FUCK WHATS GOING ON<BR>\n5-MeO-DiPT: 1.4+ for mindbreak, 0.6+ for OH FUCK WHATS GOING ON<BR>\nDiPT: 1.7+ for mindbreak, 0.6+ for OH FUCK WHATS GOING ON<BR>\nPsilocybin: 20+ for mindbreak, up to 60. Eating 99999 shrooms (or 10 pills of 30 psylocibin from chemlab) from hydro will break your serotonin receptors, causing pain, serotonin syndrome and other shit. Be warned<BR>\n4-HO-MET: absolutely identifical to psilocybin, just divide by 10 all of the doses<BR>\n4-AcO-DMT: 2+ for mindbreak, 5+ for OH FUCK WHATS GOING ON HOLY LENIN PLEASE SAVE ME NO I DONT WANT IT TO GO ON<BR>\n<BR>\nYou can mix tryptamines with MAOI for extra effect, but be warned: active dosage may be far greater than you expected it to be. Psychiatrist have some selegine from the start, but you can also buy a liana at the blackmarket and bring it into botany for neverending supply of harmaline<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Dissociatives:</B><BR>\nDXM: up to 6 for 1st plateau, up to 9 for 2nd, up to 15 for 3rd, up to 30 for 4th, 30+ for sigma. First two plateaus will never cause mindbreak.<BR>\nket: 2 to 4.5, 4.5+ will cause anesthesia<BR>\nMXE: 1 to 7, 7+ will cause anesthesia<BR>\nsalvinorin: 0.4+ for mindbreak, 0.35+ for trippin' balls, 1+ for heavy trippin' balls, 1.5+ for total clusterfuck<BR>\nAdrenochrome: 1 to 7. Yes, even this fucked-up thing CAN cause anesthesia.<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Lysergamides:</B><BR>\nLSD: 0.25+ for mindbreak<BR>\nLSA: 0.5+ for mindbreak<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Phenethylamines:</B><BR>\n<BR>\nAll of the phenethylamines are sniffable, but do you ACTUALLY want to snuff it?\n<BR>\nDOB: 0.07+ for mindbreak, up to 0.1 (this crap is toxic, wish you a good look of fucking with microdropper and soluting this shit)<BR>\nDOI: 0.07+ for mindbreak, up to 0.2<BR>\nDOC: 0.05+ for mindbreak, up to 0.2<BR>\nDOM: 0.07+ for mindbreak, up to 0.2<BR>\n25i-NBOMe: 1+ for mindbreak, up to 1.2 (I hope you have a microdropper and can survive a little OD without loosing your legs, uh?)<BR>\n25b-NBOMe: 1+ for mindbreak, up to 1.2<BR>\n2C-B: 2.7+ for mindbreak, up to 4.5 (2C-* will not damage you when ODed, but will give you heavy paranoia, randomstun and shit)<BR>\n2C-P: 2.2+ for mindbreak, up to 2 (so every serious trip is a bad trip)<BR>\n2C-I: 3+ for mindbreak, up to 2.9 (see above)<BR>\n<BR>\nUse any antipsychotic drugs to get rid of either stims, dissociatives or psychedelics if you're feel like partying too hard. Shoot benzos, GABAs or barbi (or booze, lol) to get rid of panic. Psychiatrist's den was placed so close to cognitology for a reason.<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Opiates:</B><BR>\nYou can get opiate rush by sniffing tracks of the same size needed for IV rush, but it feels a bit less pleasant against injecting.<BR>\nCodeine/tramadol: up to >0.7, 0.35+ for IV rush<BR>\nMorphine:  up to >0.6, 0.3+ for IV rush<BR>\nHeroin: up to >0.4, 0.2+ for IV rush<BR>\nMethadone: up to >0.4, 0.2+ for IV rush. FUCKING ADDICTIVE<BR>\nDesomorphine: up to >0.5, 0.25+ for IV rush. any amounts are slightly toxic<BR>\nOxycodone: up to >0.2, 0.1+ for IV rush<BR>\nHydrocodone: up to >0.3, 0.15+ for IV rush<BR>\nFentanyl: up to >0.02 (yes, you read it correctily), 0.01+ for IV rush<BR>\nBuprenorphine:up to 0.7 (through even 0.25+ will cause nausea), 0.35+ for IV rush. Blocks opioid receptors similar to naloxone, but also BREAKS through blocking so you can shoot it while naloxon'd. <BR>\nOpioids OD can be cured by naloxone, but be aware what it also stuns and torments addicts for a short time.<BR>\nOh, and shooting some succinic acid along with heroin/booze/benzo/barbi will soften addiction, while glucose have a chance of completely removing it.<BR>\n<BR>\nDicyclomine: up to 20 for mild painkilling, weak sedatation, 20+ for delirious orgy with demons and stuff jumping around<BR>\nDPH: up to 10 for anti-nausea, weak sedatation and opioids potention, 10+ for delirium<BR>\ntropicamide: up to 7.5 for anti-nausea, weak sedatation, opioids and euphoretic stims potention, 7.5+ for delirium<BR>\n<BR>\nMAOI (selegine and harmaline) will not only potent trypts, but also rape you up with serotonin syndrome if you mix it with any stim (except some phenethylamines and coffee), fluoxetine or MDMA-alike stuff.<BR>\n<BR>\nSSRI will cause serotonin syndrome if mixed with MAOI (as mentioned before), DXM, carbamazepine or tramadol.<BR>\n<BR>\n\n<B>Hard partyiiiing in da house</B><HR>\n1)To make \"hanka\", just grind a single poppy head and shoot it. Opium will slowly transform into morphine and codeine and you'll not get (seriously) ODed, but this method WILL get you an addiction and also will not cause a rush (just \"tyaga\": prolonged sedatation, pain resistance and mid-to-great (but not AHH AWESOME) mood lift).<BR><BR>\n2)For serious business version of hanka, do the following:<BR><BR>\n\ta)Grind a poppy head.<BR>\n\tb)Heat it the fuck up on electric range up to 6 to get rid of carboacid and shit, then cool to 0.<BR>\n\tb)Add ethanol to your mixture. You can use vodka or even beer, but do not use absinthe since it contains some... extra ingredients.<BR>\n\tc)Heat your mixture again to evapourate ethanol and water. Oh, and heat it up to 6 if you was using beer to remove nutriment.<BR>\n\td)Now cool it to 0. Yep, again.<BR>\n\te)If you've lucky enough (read: you got poppy with a great amount of opium), injecting this crap will give you serious OD and, probably, will kill or heavily traumatise you, so steal some microdropper and chemanalyzer (there're some hidden in the maint). <B>However, if it contains less than 6 morphine and less than 0.7 codeine, you can shoot it ignoring all the paragraphs below.</B><BR>\n\tf)Using microdropper, transfer your extract to another beaker until it'll contain >3 morphine. <B>WARNING</B>: sometimes some of the shit will be left in the dropper (you'll see what \"You transfer some liquid, but there's something left in the syringe!\"). If this shit happens, just inject dropper one more time to empty it into \"working\" beaker.<BR>\n\tg)If you don't have chemanalyzer, you're probably fucked. But I guess what 9-10 transferring injections is usually enough for getting fucked up. Or not, lol. Seriously, just steal the fucking analyzer!<BR><BR>\n3)<B>The best way to deal with poppy chests is to grow fuckload of it and bring it in a crate to your best friend - chemist. He (unlike YOU) have an access to normal chemgear, fuckload of reagents and can make a ton of heroin, desomorphine, hydrocodone and other funny things for complex-wide opiate orgy. Also, share with him this book if he don't know exact doses for opiates.</B><BR><BR>\n4)Drinking 2 cough syrups in a row will make you vomit your guts out. Why? Because they contain not only DXM, but also paracetamol and ibuprofen.<BR><BR>\n\ta)Heat syrup the fuck up to evapourate ibuprofen and water.<BR>\n\tb)Cool it down in kitchen freezer to -1 to freeze out paracetamol (yep, sorta cold water extraction)<BR>\n\tc)Get 2 (or 3-6, if you wanna party really hard) and repeat paraghraphs a) and b).<BR>\n\td)Now your syrups will contain only DXM and some sugar. Rapidly drink them in two gulps one by one. It'll also restore some hunger, lol.<BR><BR>\n5)To extract shit from ibuprofen+, just shake out all pills from the blister, put them in a beaker and evapourate ibuprofen using electric range.<BR><BR>\n6)A majority of opiate pills will contain shit like silicon, cellulose, paracetamol and so on, so you can't just drop them in a drinking glass and shoot without feeling FUCKING PAIN and taking damage. Carbon, silicon and paracetamol can be freezed out. Cellulose (which is contained in methadone pills in psychiatry and shitcurity den) can be burned out on temp 6. Naloxone cannot be extracted without chemlab stuff, but it is only contained in buproxone (along with cellulose, which you should burn out) and buprenorphine ignores opi receptors block, so you will just be unable to shoot any opiate except bupr for a while.<BR><BR>\n7)How to make mulka:<BR><BR>\n\ta)Steal/find some manganeska.<BR>\n\tb)Take a soulstorm energy drink from vendomat.<BR>\n\tc)Evapourate water from drink, freeze out caffeine.<BR>\n\td)Add a manganeska, then evapourate it out and cool the mixture so you'll not burn yourself.<BR>\n\te)Shoot a mulka with syringe and watch the sky in diamonds.<BR><BR>\n8)Also, you can abuse xanax and other sedatives by shooting multiple green syringes from emergency lockers. Drink coffee, tea or energy drinks (or get fucked up on speed) so you'll not fall asleep.<BR><BR>\n9)If you're a doctor, you can precipt yourself a crapload of shit, from DXM and ephedrine to tramadol and dextrospeed. Don't be greedy: precipt a chemist some solution ephedrini so he'll do miracles in his lab.<BR><BR>\n<BR>\n\n<B>HAX0RZ</B><HR>\n1)To hack a door, open its lock with screwdriwer, then either place a door mechanisms to set access to zero (so everyone can pass), or smash it with something heavy (hammer is fine for this), so it will stay opened until somebody close it.<BR>\n2)To hack a heavy (\"military\") door, use welding torch on it, then go to 1).<BR>\n3)You can hack some stuff (for example, drugstores and vendors) using pulse tool, but it is kinda a risky deal without energy hazmat.<BR>\n<BR>\n\n<B>Terrorism 101</B><HR>\n<BR>\n1)F.U.E.L. will burn if its temp is greater than 4. It is all what you need to know to turn station into swiss cheese.<BR>\n2)Grenade will shake its beakers on landing as well as mixing both beakers contents (if you have two beakers loaded.)<BR>\n3)Nitro and liquid vacuum will go boom when shaked (either by hand or grenade). Liquid smoke/water, napalm and montage foam - on mixing. Gunpowder - on heating.<BR>\n4)It is completely pointless to splash people in chem hazmats or antique spacesuit with your horrible crap. And only polytrinic or aqua regia can at least scratch a bit fucktards in Abyssal armor or spacegear.<BR>\n5)You're able to cut limbs off with anything sharp, including even wirecutters.<BR>\n6)Assists and engineers alike have access to F.U.E.L., which can be a devastating weapon even if you cannot into bombs. Splashing liquid F.U.E.L. (or toxin, or chlorine, or regen, or dote) at the floor will cause it to evapourate. Use it wisely.<BR>\n7)Use signaller/igniter assembly to fuckup gased rooms. Or just walk in with active welding tool, drop it and run away as fast as possible.<BR>\n8)Signallers have many hilarious usages. For example, you can attach it to stationary gastank, to amoeba box or to a floodgate (use screwdriver to remove it).<BR>\n9)Use screwdriver -> wrench to (un)bolt the door so no fucker will open it.<BR>\n10)Keep in mind what anti-stun effect of caffeine, piracetam, phenotropil and stims can and will stack. And what you can inject pills with syringe.<BR>\n11)Silicon, carbon, cellulose and some other shit are painful when injected. It is not as potent as haloperidol or thiopental, but allows you to stun and torment people for a short time.<BR>\n12)Some chemicals can be used for poisoning the items, causing the intoxication of next person picking it up. Just splash contact poison onto item for it. If you don't use novichok agent, some of the chem value will be lost, however: 3/4 for DO*, LSD and polonium, 1/2 for corpse rot, black tar, botox and atropine.<BR>\n<BR>\n\n<B>Terrorism 102</B><HR>\nYou can make tripwires from gastanks and some electronics. They're extremely powerful and hard to spot, but can (and will!) be triggered by things such as caphopper ticks, space toads or those huge bumblebees.<BR>\nTo set a tripwire, do the following:<BR>\n1)Take a fuel tank and fill it to the brim. Due to specifical way tripwire heats the gas, you need about 6 or more points of F.U.E.L. in your tank.<BR>\n2)Put igniter on a signaller, then add the resulting assembly to your tank.<BR>\n3)Add some cables to your construction.<BR>\n4)Add a <b>fully-charged</b> battery.<BR>\n5)Tripwire is finished! Just use it in the place you want to mine up.<BR>\n6)I've said before that the stuff is powerful, but I will stalindamn repeat it: <b>keep as far from your trap as possible, or explosion will reach you</b>.<BR>\n\n<BR>\n"

