BR>\nket: 2 to 4.5, 4.5+ will cause anesthesia<BR>\nMXE: 1 to 7, 7+ will cause anesthesia<BR>\nsalvinorin: 0.4+ for mindbreak, 0.35+ for trippin' balls, 1+ for heavy trippin' balls, 1.5+ for total clusterfuck<BR>\nAdrenochrome: <font color = red>CENSORED</font> Yes, even this fucked-up thing CAN cause anesthesia.<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Lysergamides:</B><BR>\nLSD: 0.25+ for mindbreak<BR>\nLSA: 0.5+ for mindbreak<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Phenethylamines:</B><BR>\n<BR>\nAll of the phenethylamines are sniffable, but do you ACTUALLY want to snuff it?\n<BR>\nDOB: 0.07+ for mindbreak, up to 0.1 (this crap is toxic, wish you a good look of fucking with microdropper and soluting this shit)<BR>\nDOI: 0.07+ for mindbreak, up to 0.2<BR>\nDOC: 0.05+ for mindbreak, up to 0.2<BR>\nDOM: 0.07+ for mindbreak, up to 0.2<BR>\n25i-NBOMe: 1+ for mindbreak, up to 1.2 (I hope you have a microdropper and can survive a little OD without loosing your legs, uh?)<BR>\n25b-NBOMe: 1+ for mindbreak, up to 1.2<BR>\n2C-B: 2.7+ for mindbreak, up to 4.5 (2C-* will not damage you when ODed, but will give you heavy paranoia, randomstun and shit)<BR>\n2C-P: 2.2+ for mindbreak, up to 2 (so every serious trip is a bad trip)<BR>\n2C-I: 3+ for mindbreak, up to 2.9 (see above)<BR>\n<BR>\nUse any antipsychotic drugs to get rid of either stims, dissociatives or psychedelics if you're feel like partying too hard. Shoot benzos, GABAs or barbi (or booze, lol) to get rid of panic. Psychiatrist's den was placed so close to cognitology for a reason.<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Opiates:</B><BR>\nYou can get opiate rush by sniffing tracks of the same size needed for IV rush, but it feels a bit less pleasant against injecting.<BR>\nCodeine/tramadol: up to >0.7, <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for IV rush<BR>\nMorphine:  up to >0.6, <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for IV rush<BR>\nHeroin: up to >0.4, <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for IV rush<BR>\nMethadone: up to >0.4, <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for IV rush. FUCKING ADDICTIVE<BR>\nDesomorphine: <font color = red>CENSORED</font> any amounts are slightly toxic<BR>\nOxycodone: up to >0.2, <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for IV rush<BR>\nHydrocodone: up to >0.3, <font color = red>CENSORED</font>for IV rush<BR>\nFentanyl: up to >0.02 (yes, you read it correctily), <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for IV rush<BR>\nBuprenorphine:up to 0.7 (through even 0.25+ will cause nausea), <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for IV rush. Blocks opioid receptors similar to naloxone, but also BREAKS through blocking so you can shoot it while naloxon'd. <BR>\nOpioids OD can be cured by naloxone, but be aware what it also stuns and torments addicts for a short time.<BR>\nOh, and shooting some succinic acid along with heroin/booze/benzo/barbi will soften addiction, while glucose have a chance of completely removing it.<BR>\n<BR>\nDicyclomine: up to 20 for mild painkilling, weak sedatation, <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for delirious orgy with demons and stuff jumping around<BR>\nDPH: up to 10 for anti-nausea, weak sedatation and opioids potention, <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for delirium<BR>\ntropicamide: up to 7.5 for anti-nausea, weak sedatation, opioids and euphoretic stims potention, <font color = red>CENSORED</font> for delirium<BR>\n<BR>\nMAOI (selegine and harmaline) will not only potent trypts, but also rape you up with serotonin syndrome if you mix it with any stim (except some phenethylamines and coffee), fluoxetine or MDMA-alike stuff.<BR>\n<BR>\nSSRI will cause serotonin syndrome if mixed with MAOI (as mentioned before), DXM, carbamazepine or tramadol.<BR>\n<BR>\n\n<B>Hard partyiiiing in da house</B><HR>\n1)To make \"hanka\", <font color = red>CENSORED</font><BR>\n2)For serious business version of hanka, <font color = red>CENSORED</font><BR>\n3)<B>The best way to deal with poppy chests is to grow fuckload of it and bring it in a crate to your best friend - chemist. He (unlike YOU) have an access to normal chemgear, fuckload of reagents and can make a ton of heroin, desomorphine, hydrocodone and other funny things for complex-wide opiate orgy. Also, share with him this book if he don't know exact doses for opiates.</B><BR><BR>\n4)Drinking 2 cough syrups in a row will make you vomit your guts out. Why? Because they're contain not only DXM, but also paracetamol and ibuprofen.<BR><BR>\n\ta)Heat syrup the fuck up to evapourate ibuprofen and water.<BR>\n\tb)Cool it down in kitchen freezer to -1 to freeze out paracetamol (yep, sorta cold water extraction)<BR>\n\tc)Get 2 (or 3-6, if you wanna party really hard) and repeat paraghraphs a) and b).<BR>\n\td)Now your syrups will contain only DXM and some sugar. Rapidly drink them in two gulps one by one. It'll also restore some hunger, lol.<BR><BR>\n5)To extract shit from ibuprofen+, just shake out all pills from the blister, put them in a beaker and evapourate ibuprofen using electric range.<BR><BR>\n6)A majority of opiate pills will contain shit like silicon, cellulose, paracetamol and so on, so you can't just drop them in a drinking glass and shoot without feeling FUCKING PAIN and taking damage. <font color = red>CENSORED</font>. Naloxone cannot be extracted without chemlab stuff, but it is only contained in buproxone (along with cellulose, which you should burn out) and buprenorphine ignores opi receptors block, so you will just be unable to shoot any opiate except bupr for a while.<BR><BR>\n7)How to make mulka:<BR>\n<font color = red>CENSORED</font><BR>\n8)Also, you can abuse xanax and other sedatives by <font color = red>CENSORED</font><BR>\n9)If you're a doctor, you can precipt yourself a crapload of shit, from DXM and ephedrine to tramadol and dextrospeed. Don't be greedy: precipt a chemist some solution ephedrini so he'll do miracles in his lab.<BR><BR>\n<BR>\n\n<B>HAX0RZ</B><HR>\n<font color = red>CENSORED</font>\n<BR>\n\n<B>Terrorism 101</B><HR>\n<font color = red>CENSORED</font>\n<BR>\n\n<B>Terrorism 102</B><HR>\nYou can make tripwires <font color = red>CENSORED</font>\n<BR>\n"

