	txt = "<font size=25><B>A very fucking basics of medicine</B></font><HR>\n<BR>\n<B>Hwo I cuer psychos???</B><HR>\nYou're both neuropatologist and psychiatrist, so most of the people will be dropped from medbay into psychiatry clinic foyer (eastern room of your lair) with either epilepsy (which is cureable by medics, by they can be retarded or lazy).<BR>\nOh, and there're cognitologists. They DO have a haloperidol bottle for bad trips, but you should cure them of deliriants or other hallucinogenic drugs overdose if you see them crawling around.<BR>\n<BR>\n<B>Okay, let's go:<B><HR>\n<BR>\n<B>Your uniform.</B> Works just like CNS scanner due to aura-seeking glasses while examining somebody. Yea, even if somebody cut out your head!\n<B>CNS scanner.</B> You will use it if somebody stripped you and stole your uniform. Shows epilepsy, chronic depression level, depression potencial which will add 1 to chronodepr if reaches 100 (usually caused by too many beating, pain, withdrawal, delirium and other such shit) and serotonin syndrome (if you see it in your scanner or aura glasses, shoot poor fucker with fuckload of mangadote AND regenerite RIGHT NOW or he's fucked). Also, it shows all bad conditions (like nausea, thrill, or tongue numbness) and level of all patient's addictions with exact number of REAL addiction start. I.E. if somebody ate 2 pills of benzo and got 40 addiction, then it is ok. But if he abuses benzos all day erryday and have addiction of 150, then he is fucked when his stocks are gone.<BR>\n<B>Brain spectrometer.</B> Shows how fucked in the mind person is. Also, shows numbers of receptors damage excessing which will drown poor cognitologist into neverending torment. All antipsychotics cure receptor damage in large doses, and you even have some huge brain restoration injectors! In general, it is strongly recommended to cure some receptor damage after exploring cognitology SUPERPOWAHS just in case of random chemist with syringe gun full of DOB.<BR>\n<B>Stamp.</B> Just like docs, you have a rubber stamp to raid drugstores for stuff, but you're also short on recipes. Good thing is what you can re-forge recipe up to 2 times, so 1 recipe is actually can be used to order 3 different drugs!\n<B>Hospitalisation.</B> You can use shocker, haloperidol-loaded syringes/syringe guns or police baton to stun unruly patients, then taking them sleepy-dose of benzos, drug for their disorder and dragging them into cells. Haloguns and shockers also are good in case of fuckers raiding psychiatry.<BR>\n<BR>\n\n<B>All those pills.</B>\n<BR>\n<B>Fluoxetine</B>. SSRI antidepressant drug. Cures chronic depression rapid as fuck, will react in a shitty way with carbamazepine, DXM, tramadol and any kind of MAOI.<BR>\n<B>Selegeline/harmaline.</B>MAOI antidepressant drugs. Harmaline is a bit more powerful, but harder to put your hands on. Cures chronodepr just like fluoxetine. NEVER mix it with any stims (except coffee or piracetam), MDMA-class drugs or SSRI.<BR>\n<B>MDA/MDMA/MDOH.</B> Surprisingly effective at curing chronodepr, as well as at granting patient good mood (and depros, obviously, feel like shit all the time). Empathopentin drug contains some MDA as well as a fuckload of weak antidepressants. Especially good if you're staying in view of patient, since empathogenic effect potents from both people and robots in front of MDA-user.<BR>\n<B>DPH/tropicamide/manganeska/mangadote.</B> Forces patient to stop vomiting all around. DPH (a.k.a. <B>dimedrol</B>) is also a very weak sedative and you have a blister of this stuff from the start (just remember what it is also causes ungodly delirium when ODed, similar to Trigan-D and all other anticholinergics), and both empathopentin pills and lithium oxybutyrate ampules contains some manganeska for anti-nausea and detox effect.<BR>\n<B>Weed, tryptamines, acid and other psychedelics.</B> Heals dysthymia (chronodepr) with a small chance. Funny, but not very useful.<BR>\n<B>AMT.</B> Probably, the only psychedelic able to cure dysthymia less or more effective. Contained in DiPT-indopan: pills which makes people trippy for a short time, but also good for rising mood and curing dysthymia<BR>\n<B>Dextroamitriptine</B> A wonder drug, healing stims and nicotine addictions almost instantly.<BR>\n<B>Carbamazepine.</B> Heals epilepsy, and (on rare occasions) chonodepr.<BR>\n<B>Haloperidol.</B> Heavy-duty antipsychotic. Use it as stunner or actual delirium/bad trip cure, but don't forget what it will damage patient a bit.<BR>\n<B>Aminazine.</B> Yet another antipsychotic drug. Less shitty agaist halo, but still can stun and damage patient.<BR>\n<B>Clozapine.</B> The most harmless of all antipsychotics, stuns only in huge doses, never damage patients.<BR>\n<B>Risperidone and paliperidone.</B> Just like clozapine, but drains patient's euphoria. Don't forget what xanax and CBD cause euphoria and are not removed by antipsychotics!<BR>\n<B>Trihexyphenidyl.</B> Also known as <B>cyclodol</B>. Softens up side-effects effects of aminazine, clozapine, risperidone and paliperidone. Removes halo from one's blood, so they can't be combined, but you can use cyclodol in Just like DPH, be careful: overfeeding patient with cyclodol will cause infernal delirium.<BR>\n<B>Glucose.</B><HR> Used in a crapload of combi-pills and avaible in pure form in psychiatry. Slowly cures all kinds of addictions (except stim one) and can be used as a food (alas, even less efective than sugar) so your patients will not die of hunger.<BR>\n<B>Gabapentin.</B><HR> Cures epilepsy, calms down patient and causes mild euphoria. Potents benzos euphoria, so can be used in combination with alprazolam while curing depros.<BR>\n<B>Phenazepam, diazepam, alprazolam, triazolam.</B><HR> \"Lesser\" benzodiazepines. Cures epilepsy and some of the shitty conditions like non-dysthymia depression or thrill, causes weak (with exception of somewhat euphoretic xanax, which even have a small chance of curing one point of dysthymia!) euphoria, cures delirium, removes a majority of deliriants from poor soul's blood and calms down patient. Yes, they're \"lesser\", but overfeeding somebody with them WILL cause a person to fall asleep or even have OD or fucking addiction. And yes, they ARE addictive.<BR>\n<B>Midazolam, clonazepam, nitrazepam, cosmozepam.</B><HR> \"Bigger\" benzodiazepines. Works just like common benzos, but 2 pills usually cause one to either take a nap for a while or (especially - with midazolam) OD and both sleep and vomit. Use with caution.<BR>\n<B>Naloxone.</B><HR> Blocks opioid receptors so junkie will get nothing after daily heroin shot and slooowly cures opioid addiction. Also, works as antidote to any of the opiates so this thing is the only chance for ODed junkie to survive besides fuckload of injections or regenerite and mangadote. Tortures opiate addicts from time to time, so give them some non-opiate painkillers (2 pills Trigan-D, some paracetamol-containing shit or, the better way, some dissociatives if you have any since dicyclomine from trigan and paracetamol just removes pain while disses make you pain-immune).<BR>\n<B>Flumazenil.</B><HR> Like naloxone, but for benzodiazepine addicts. Make benzos useless to junkie, but, at least, not torture him like naloxone. Also slowly cures benzo addiction if its factor >85.<BR>\n<B>Buprenorphine.</B> Opioid which both blocks opi receptors similar to naloxone AND ignores this blockade. Usually comes in pack with naloxone so nalox will not torture patient and bupr will (hopefully) not rise addiction.<BR>\n<B>Codeine, tramadol, methadone and so on.</B> Opioids and opiates. Removes pain and make you immune to it for a while which is good for patients twitching in pain due to receptor damage, serotonin syndrome, tormenting via prosecutor console by some sneaky assistant or something. Obviously, all of them are addictive as fuck, but one pill of methadone will not cause actual addiction, especially when combined with glucose.<BR>\n<B>DXM, ketamine, MXE and so on.</B> Dissociatives. Same shit like with opiates: makes you pain-proof. You have some ketamine from the start. 7+ of all dissociatives will force you to fall asleep, so it is a good idea to mix 10 ket with fuckload of neuroleptics so patient will not be tormented by his damaged brains and even will get some euphoria, suppressable by a majority of antipsychotics!<BR>\n\n"

