	txt = "<font size=25><B>Partially and fully known spellcodes</B></font><HR>\n<B><font color = red>Warning: this machine is radioactive. Also, the way it channels the so-called 'magic' is dangerous for your mind. Use at your own risk.</font><B>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>alii ianuae magicae</B><HR>\nThis spellcode teleports every (un)living creature around at the arrival telepoint of the main station.<BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>et herbis</B><HR>\nOne of the less harmful (if you're not minding Machinae side effects) spellcode, it channels magic to teleport a herb oil from some planet to your body.<BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>exorcismo</B><HR>\nYes, this spellcode does exactly what you think: banishes any 'ghosts' around from our dimension. Surprisingly, but this code is very similar to the same ritual used by humans.<BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>vulnus sa<I>?</I>itatem</B><HR>\nAnother less-or-more harmless spellcode, rituals this one is based on are used by alien shamans to stop bleeding from wounds.<BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>salutem de fam<I>?</I></B><HR>\nAn emergency source of nutriments, this spellcode feeds you for good, but might have some side-effects.<BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>per vim Spi<I>?</I>itus</B><HR>\nThis spellcode is based on the same shamanistic rituals using in 'God's hand' cognitology lab. Probably, it is able to save somebody's mind and personality from fading. Rituals this spellcode based on are used by aliens and can damage the human user, however.<BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>a<I>??</I>sso c<I>?</I>rrup<I>?</I>a</B><HR>\nWe don't know what exactly this spellcode does, but it is suggested what it is somehow linked with exotic matter.<BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>corr<I>??</I>tio corporis</B><HR>\nThis spellcode probably linked to some of the alien shamanistic medicine. May have side-effects on humans, however.<BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>a<I>??</I>ima libera</B><HR>\nThis spellcode is based on a ritual which was used by a cult of aliens who throught what every life (every dangerous one) is sacred. We hope what you don't share their opinion.<BR>\n<B>d<I>??</I>ra lux</B><HR>\nLike many other spellcodes, this one is based on an alien ritual. Now its source rituals was used by a star-worshipping aliens, so be VERY cautious.<BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<BR><BR>\n<B>cor<I>p</I>us inci<I>??</I>ratio</B><HR>\nA truly dangerous spellcode, it burns everybody (including spellcoder) alive in a huge range.<BR>\n"

/obj/item/readable/magicks


